OL,3,GNEWSAArrest after car hits eight parked
OL,4,Avehicles
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 41-year-old man has been arrested
OL,7,Fafter a car being driven the wrong way
OL,8,Fdown a road hit eight parked vehicles.
OL,10,FSussex Police said it responded to
OL,11,Freports of an intoxicated man in a car
OL,12,Fverbally abusing the public in Lewes
OL,13,FRoad, Brighton, at about 16:50 BST on
OL,14,FSunday.
OL,16,FWhen officers arrived at the scene the
OL,17,Fvehicle had left, though it was found
OL,18,Fby The Level two hours later, a police
OL,19,Fspokesperson said.
OL,21,FPolice said they tried to speak to the
OL,22,Fman, but he drove away.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
